	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AK7Ms4XVfymw5WeB9",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 7, DX 13, IQ 9, HT 10, HP 7, WILL 9, PER 9, FP 10, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AFrzq6uQR4VV-VanE",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 2 (offense 6, protection -4), threat tier minor, appearing 4."
		},
		{
			"id": "AxgfqncI4W4OQoSWf",
			"text": "Steam Storm (2d burning), reach 4 yards: By spending 3 FP, a steam mephit can create a storm of steam in the area around him. Every creature within 4 yards of him takes 2d non-incendiary burning damage. Treat it as large area injury for the purpose of DR."
		},
		{
			"id": "ARcjO8dCJu0UTZwRw",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/steam-mephit.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "Ahxtm6EoIcRK0rJKd",
			"text": "Source template total: 160 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "A8Vba5WglVI64Du5d",
			"text": "Library-rebuilt template total: 160 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "Avajmdz7wGa15WOQj",
			"text": "CER was computed from parsed Typical Stats using the Dungeons On Automatic baseline CER path."
		},
		{
			"id": "AaWSeVz0nIGxqOEQy",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
		{
			"id": "AFq1gLoHx4rgjTWTr",
			"text": "Vapor Blur: Once per hour, a steam mephit can surround himself with vapor. This reaches to a two-yard radius around the mephit. With care, it can include a few friends as well. Subtract 4 from any attempts to see the mephit using normal vision, Infravision, or Ladar; there is no resistance roll. Even if someone does manage to see the mephit, subtract 4 from any attack roll against him that relies on vision to hit. The mephit itself can see perfectly while using this ability. It activates this ability by taking a Concentrate maneuver. Each activation lasts for 1 minute."
		},
		{
			"id": "Aa9HZf95AVm-VcofI",
			"text": "Original GURPS conversion by Enraged Eggplant, from Monsters (May 11, 2024); adapted and republished with permission."
		}
